   "text": "Deployment vs federated learning:\n- Zones downloading global_v0 at the start is deployment.\n- Federated learning starts after the zones have learned locally:\n  each round, zones push their weights, the cloud averages them\n  (FedAvg, weighted by experience count), publishes global_vk on\n  fl/global, and zones pull it, then fine-tune briefly on local data.",
   "originalText": "Deployment vs federated learning:\n- Zones downloading global_v0 at the start is deployment.\n- Federated learning starts after the zones have learned locally:\n  each round, zones push their weights, the cloud averages them\n  (FedAvg, weighted by experience count), publishes global_vk on\n  fl/global, and zones pull it, then fine-tune briefly on local data.",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true,
