   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "8. WHAT EACH PIECE IS (one line each)",
   "originalText": "8. WHAT EACH PIECE IS (one line each)",
   "fontSize": 32,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true,
   "roundness": null
  },
  {
   "id": "te245",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 4760.0,
   "width": 1325.24,
   "height": 21.25,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "seed": 394887584,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 283684098,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "MQTT: a publish/subscribe protocol. Senders publish to a topic (car/42/result); the broker delivers to every subscriber of that topic.",
   "originalText": "MQTT: a publish/subscribe protocol. Senders publish to a topic (car/42/result); the broker delivers to every subscriber of that topic.",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true,
   "roundness": null
  },
  {
   "id": "te246",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 4784.65,
   "width": 1295.6599999999999,
   "height": 21.25,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "seed": 2035206439,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1083162951,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "EMQX: the broker program (open source, can run as a cluster of machines that act as one). Mosquitto would also work in the testbed.",
   "originalText": "EMQX: the broker program (open source, can run as a cluster of machines that act as one). Mosquitto would also work in the testbed.",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true,
   "roundness": null
  },
  {
   "id": "te247",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 4809.3,
   "width": 1275.9399999999998,
   "height": 21.25,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "seed": 319760307,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1140563901,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Metro edge: a regional site a few ms from every zone, between the zones and the cloud. The broker lives there in the real design.",
   "originalText": "Metro edge: a regional site a few ms from every zone, between the zones and the cloud. The broker lives there in the real design.",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true,
   "roundness": null
  },
  {
   "id": "te248",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 4833.95,
   "width": 1275.9399999999998,
   "height": 21.25,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "seed": 1008396568,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 881402584,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "MQTT is a messenger, not a database: it remembers only the last message of retained topics. All state lives in the zones' memory.",
   "originalText": "MQTT is a messenger, not a database: it remembers only the last message of retained topics. All state lives in the zones' memory.",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true,
   "roundness": null
  },
  {
   "id": "te249",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 4858.6,
   "width": 1305.52,
   "height": 21.25,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "seed": 991004122,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1977145509,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Bulk data over HTTP: a 200 KB frame goes to exactly one node, so it travels zone to zone directly; MQTT carries only small messages.",
   "originalText": "Bulk data over HTTP: a 200 KB frame goes to exactly one node, so it travels zone to zone directly; MQTT carries only small messages.",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true,
   "roundness": null
  },
  {
   "id": "te250",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 4883.25,
   "width": 1236.5,
   "height": 21.25,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "seed": 2121493856,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1643084754,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "QoS 0 = may be lost (GPS, state: a new one comes 100 ms later). QoS 1 = resent until confirmed (results, acks, attach, work).",
   "originalText": "QoS 0 = may be lost (GPS, state: a new one comes 100 ms later). QoS 1 = resent until confirmed (results, acks, attach, work).",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true,
   "roundness": null
  },
  {
   "id": "te251",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 4907.9,
   "width": 1285.8,
   "height": 21.25,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "seed": 329595264,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 2057332978,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Last will: a message the broker publishes for a client that dies; here zone/{id}/status = offline, so neighbours stop choosing it.",
   "originalText": "Last will: a message the broker publishes for a client that dies; here zone/{id}/status = offline, so neighbours stop choosing it.",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true,
   "roundness": null
  },
  {
